            <div class="col-lg-8 content-page-wrapper" id="content-wrapper">
                <h1>Continuous Disclosure Filing Calendar</h1>

                
                

                
                

                <link href="/css/bootstrap-datepicker/bootstrap-datepicker.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />



    <div class="main-search-wrapper">
<form action="/industry/issuer-regulation/continuous-disclosure-obligations/continuous-disclosure-filing-calendar" class="single-search-wrapper" id="search-reports-form" method="post">            <label>Filter by Year</label>
            <div class="input-group">
                <select class="form-select" id="FilterDate" name="FilterDate"><option selected="selected" value="2026">2026</option>
<option value="2025">2025</option>
<option value="2024">2024</option>
<option value="2023">2023</option>
<option value="2022">2022</option>
<option value="2021">2021</option>
<option value="2020">2020</option>
<option value="2019">2019</option>
<option value="2018">2018</option>
</select>
            </div>
</form>    </div>
<p>These are the filing due dates by quarter for 2025-2026. Due dates take into account weekends and statutory holidays.</p>
<p><a href="-/media/45135D790A2C46AFAFB76FE56BD56B02.ashx" target="_blank">View&nbsp;PDF version</a>.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Interim filings include financial statements and MD&amp;A</li>
    <li>Annual filings include financial statements, MD&amp;A, and AIF</li>
    <li>If you are a venture issuer, you will only need to file an AIF if you are qualified for the short form offering system</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="~/link.aspx?_id=12B55D73F30F4398BC9A60146091A493&amp;_z=z">Reporting Requirements FAQ</a></p>
